# Sync with Wi-Fi never set up in OnionOS: the SPECIFIC rc=2 message pointing at OnionOS's
# own Wi-Fi settings — never a reimplemented creds flow, never an engine call.
desc app menu: Wi-Fi not set up -> honest message, no engine call
invoke app
config paired
wifi down
pick 0
pick 255
expect_exit 0
expect_trace Wi-Fi isn't set up yet
expect_trace_absent ENGINE
